Starting fresh training
Using cpu device
Wrapping the env in a VecTransposeImage.
Vision-based training: 200,000,000 timesteps  (seed=0)
Image: 48x48, frame stack: 3
State: 10D (gravity_unit(3) + body_rates(3) + prev_action(4))
Feature extractor: CoarseCNN(64D) + FineCNN(128D) + StateMLP(64D) = 256D
Curriculum: medium(0-30%) -> ramp(30-80%) -> full(80-100%)
Motion blur: OFF (VQ1 default — full render throughput all run)
Envs: 4 (SubprocVecEnv)   save_dir: surface_seed0
Eval: every 5,000 steps, 3 episodes -> eval/gates_passed + eval/success_rate
Logging to surface_seed0\tb_logs\PPO_1

